\par }{\b\f0\cf0\ulc0\insrsid4340796 
\par }{\b\f0\cf0\ulc0\insrsid933580 DSS (digital data service)  }{\f0\cf0\ulc0\insrsid4350687\charrsid4350687  is the telephone service in which there is no need of dialing}{\b\f0\cf0\ulc0\insrsid4350687 .}{\b\f0\cf0\ulc0\insrsid4340796 
