\f0\cf0\ulc0\insrsid10816525 
\par 
\par }{\cf0\ulc0\insrsid10816525 How does the checksum checker know that the received data unit is undamaged? [3]
\par }{\b\f0\cf0\ulc0\insrsid351732 
\par Answer:}{\b\f0\cf0\ulc0\insrsid10816525 
\par }{\b\f0\cf0\ulc0\insrsid351732 
\par Checksum Checker or generator:
\par }\pard \qj \fi-360\li1080\ri0\nowidctlpar\faauto\rin0\lin1080\itap0\pararsid351732 {\f0\insrsid351732\charrsid351732 The sender subdivides data units into equal segments of \lquote n\rquote  bits(16 bits)
\par {\listtext\pard\plain\cf1\ulc1\insrsid351732\charrsid351732 \hich\af0\dbch\af0\loch\f0 1.\tab}}\pard \qj \fi-360\li1440\ri0\nowidctlpar\faauto\ls29\rin0\lin1440\itap0\pararsid351732 {\f0\insrsid351732\charrsid351732 
These segments are added together using one\rquote s complement}{\f0\insrsid218795 .}{\f0\insrsid351732\charrsid351732 
\par {\listtext\pard\plain\cf1\ulc1\insrsid351732\charrsid351732 \hich\af0\dbch\af0\loch\f0 2.\tab}The total (sum) is then complemented and appended to the end of the original data unit as redundancy bits called CHECKSUM}{\f0\insrsid3890936 .}{
\f0\insrsid351732\charrsid351732 
\par {\listtext\pard\plain\cf1\ulc1\insrsid351732\charrsid351732 \hich\af0\dbch\af0\loch\f0 3.\tab}The extended data unit is transmitted across the network}{\f0\insrsid3890936 .}{\f0\insrsid351732\charrsid351732 
\par {\listtext\pard\plain\cf1\ulc1\insrsid351732\charrsid351732 \hich\af0\dbch\af0\loch\f0 4.\tab}Th}{\f0\insrsid3890936 e receiver subdivides data unit }{\f0\insrsid351732\charrsid351732 and adds all segments together and complement the result}{
\f0\insrsid3890936 .}{\f0\insrsid351732\charrsid351732 
\par {\listtext\pard\plain\cf1\ulc1\insrsid351732\charrsid351732 \hich\af0\dbch\af0\loch\f0 5.\tab}If the intended data unit is intact, total value found by adding the data segments and the checksum field should be zero}{\f0\insrsid3890936 .}{
\f0\insrsid351732\charrsid351732 
\par {\listtext\pard\plain\cf1\ulc1\insrsid351732\charrsid351732 \hich\af0\dbch\af0\loch\f0 6.\tab}}\pard \ql \fi-360\li1440\ri0\nowidctlpar\faauto\ls29\rin0\lin1440\itap0\pararsid351732 {\f0\insrsid351732\charrsid351732 
If the result is not zero, the packet contains an error & the receiver rejects it}{\f0\insrsid3890936 .}{\b\f0\cf0\ulc0\insrsid351732\charrsid351732 
\par }\pard \ql \li0\ri0\nowidctlpar\faauto\rin0\lin0\itap0\pararsid10816525 {\b\f0\cf0\ulc0\insrsid351732 
\par 
\par 
